Test call_rcu() call stack recording and verify whether it correctly
is printed in KASAN report.

Signed-off-by: Walter Wu <walter-zh.wu@mediatek.com>
Reviewed-and-tested-by: Dmitry Vyukov <dvyukov@google.com>
